# ==============================================================================
# AI STUDY ASSISTANT — MASTER INTEGRATION TEST SUITE
# ==============================================================================
# Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
# Ensure your FastAPI server is running: uvicorn app.main:app --reload
#
# Variables are defined below to avoid repeating hosts or tokens.
# ==============================================================================

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = Bearer any-token-works-for-now
@session_id = valid-session-123


# ==============================================================================
# 1. SYSTEM HEALTH & METADATA
# ==============================================================================

### Health Check (Verify system is up)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### API Information (Verify configuration settings)
GET {{host}}/api/info


# ==============================================================================
# 2. GLOBAL EXCEPTION HANDLING & CORS
# ==============================================================================

### Test Unhandled Exception (Should return safe 500 error, trace ID, hides stack)
GET {{host}}/api/test-error

### Test Custom NotFoundException (Should return consistent 404 shape)
GET {{host}}/api/test-not-found

### Test Route 404 (Verify FastAPI's fallback router overrides)
GET {{host}}/api/this-does-not-exist

### Simulate CORS Browser Preflight (Verify access control headers)
OPTIONS {{host}}/api/chat-sessions
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type


# ==============================================================================
# 3. AUTHENTICATION BOUNDARY TESTS (get_current_user dependency)
# ==============================================================================

### Missing Authorization Header (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions

### Malformed Authorization Format (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions
Authorization: InvalidFormat token123

### Empty Token String (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions
Authorization: Bearer 


# ==============================================================================
# 4. CHAT SESSION RETRIEVAL (get_pagination & get_current_user)
# ==============================================================================

### List Sessions — Defaults (Page 1, Limit 10)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions
Authorization: {{token}}

### List Sessions — Pagination (Custom Page and Limit)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions?limit=5&page=2
Authorization: {{token}}

### List Sessions — Filtered Search (Query strings)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions?search=recursion&limit=5
Authorization: {{token}}

### List Sessions — Validation Failure (Limit ge bounds: 500 > 100)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions?limit=500
Authorization: {{token}}

### List Sessions — Validation Failure (Page ge bounds: 0 < 1)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions?page=0
Authorization: {{token}}

### Retrieve Single Session by ID
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}
Authorization: {{token}}


# ==============================================================================
# 5. CONCURRENT RETRIEVAL (asyncio.gather Demonstration)
# ==============================================================================

### Retrieve Full Session, Messages, and Metadata Concurrently (Completes in ~500ms)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/full
Authorization: {{token}}


# ==============================================================================
# 6. CHAT SESSION LIFECYCLE (POST, DELETE, SUMMARY)
# ==============================================================================

### Create Chat Session — With Title
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "title": "Algorithms & Data Structures Study"
}

### Create Chat Session — Optional Title Omitted (Verify default=None works)
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{}

### Get Session Summary — Default Format (brief)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/summary
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Session Summary — Detailed Format
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/summary?format=detailed
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Session Summary — Validation Failure (nonsense is not in Literal)
GET {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/summary?format=nonsense
Authorization: {{token}}

### Delete Chat Session (Returns 204. Triggers background audit log task)
DELETE {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}
Authorization: {{token}}


# ==============================================================================
# 7. DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT (Async-converted Route)
# ==============================================================================

### List Uploaded Study Documents (Converted to async in Exercise 1)
GET {{host}}/api/documents
Authorization: {{token}}


# ==============================================================================
# 8. RATE LIMITER STRESS TESTING (In-Memory sliding window check)
# ==============================================================================
# Run the requests below rapidly.
# The limiter permits 10 messages per minute.
# The 11th request will trigger a "429 Too Many Requests" response instantly.
# ==============================================================================

### Message 1
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 1" }

### Message 2
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 2" }

### Message 3
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 3" }

### Message 4
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 4" }

### Message 5
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 5" }

### Message 6
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 6" }

### Message 7
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 7" }

### Message 8
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 8" }

### Message 9
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 9" }

### Message 10
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 10" }

### Message 11 (Should fail with 429 and return headers Retry-After: 60)
POST {{host}}/api/chat-sessions/{{session_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "content": "Limit test: 11 (Should be rejected)" }

# ==============================================================================
# 7. DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT & FILE UPLOADS
# ==============================================================================

### List Documents — Initially Empty
GET {{host}}/api/documents
Authorization: {{token}}


### Upload Valid TXT File (Multipart form data)
POST {{host}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="lecture_notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Data Structures & Algorithms - Week 1:
Stacks, Queues, and Linked Lists.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### Upload Invalid File Extension (.py should return 422)
POST {{host}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="script.py"
Content-Type: text/plain

print("Malicious script execution attempt")
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### Upload Invalid MIME Type (application/json should return 422)
POST {{host}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: application/json

{"data": "invalid mime"}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### List Documents — Verify Uploaded File Appears
GET {{host}}/api/documents
Authorization: {{token}}